   "text": "Skate like they ain't nothin' doin', live life, don't say nothin' to 'em"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.1,
   "end": 99.4,
   "text": "Spectators, sideliners"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.5,
   "end": 101.8,
   "text": "Spend their days comin' up with sly comments"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.9,
   "end": 104.3,
   "text": "That's psychotic, why tarnish a fly product?"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.4,
   "end": 106.5,
   "text": "Why be mad just 'cause I got it?"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.6,
   "end": 107.9,
   "text": "Hate, I may never know"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.0,
   "end": 110.2,
   "text": "Wave to the haters that put me on a pedestal"
  },
  {
   "start": 110.3,
   "end": 112.6,
   "text": "Talk smack, but they really know I'm incredible"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.7,
